\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Propagator instrumentation on representative solved runs. \emph  {decide calls} and \emph  {cand./decide} are taken from the Prolog backend, which counts every candidate the \texttt  {heuristic/4} query returns; \emph  {ms/decide} is the average time of one consultation, reported by both backends; \emph  {sync} is the cumulative cost of mirroring the solver trail into the Prolog database; \emph  {prop.\ share} is the fraction of the Prolog run spent inside the propagator (query plus synchronization). The native backend's own synchronization is not shown because it never exceeds $0.3$ seconds in the whole campaign.}}{34}{table.0.8}\protected@file@percent }
